      "source": "When the value of this property is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) (the default) and the gesture recognizer is analyzing touch events, the window suspends delivery of touch objects in the [`UITouch.Phase.ended`](uitouch/phase-swift.enum/ended.md) phase to the attached view.",
